{"overview":"مایکل که سال‌ها در دنیای تبهکاری فعالیت داشته، با آشنایی با دایانا درگیر عشقی تازه می‌شود. این عشق او را به فکر ترک گذشته می‌اندازد، اما ممکن است همان چیزی باشد که همه‌چیز را به خطر می‌اندازد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Notorious gang boss Ronnie (Sean Bean) steps back from his criminal empire, triggering a violent power struggle between his volatile son Jamie (Jack McMullen) and trusted lieutenant Michael (James Nelson Joyce), who sees his chance to seize control. As rivalries ignite and loyalties fracture, the family behind the city’s cocaine trade descends into open war.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":8,"y":2025,"poster":"/qpGePYte0rJiSRC0bVb07SYyZdE.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":8,"y":2026,"poster":""}],"episodes":16,"crew":["Stephen Butchard"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["GB"],"cast":[{"name":"Julie Graham","role":"Elaine Phelan","photo":"/oqk7TrAdD8qrgE5XLxLAsLhZrsQ.jpg"},{"name":"Mike Noble","role":"Banksey","photo":""},{"name":"Laura Aikman","role":"Rachel Duffy","photo":"/i8vcM4i2uTMrYbk9h4W6KDRCgNm.jpg"},{"name":"Shaun Evans","role":"Ozzie Thompson","photo":"/fqEw8H5VRN2SyV8QMT9toHEYDpl.jpg"},{"name":"آلوارو مورته","role":"Felipe Guzman","photo":"/2TGPhdpRC5wjdFEJqnLYiN5kbwg.jpg","en":"Álvaro Morte"}],"trailer":"9irsgS7DEUI","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/255570-this-city-is-ours/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Philo","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/mfbhzQwmQKjm7bLZPF5CTeu3Ilc.png"},{"n":"AMC Plus Apple TV channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/wLl5LRLVC6UOSaUlsmuzY0H9LS1.png"},{"n":"AMC+ Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/tg5ufQ1GkYDCMxSSxemfeKWcvRe.png"},{"n":"AMC+ Roku Premium Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/xMyod7PSWlER7Q8FLDqVckKeyyB.png"},{"n":"AMC+","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/wsCUflcmL4dCkzBUaGP8cj1cTkh.png"},{"n":"Spectrum On Demand","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/6qPtM96UZkt3Bu4ZFPsDeHFWUZ2.png"},{"n":"The Roku Channel","kind":"ads","logo":"/b7uhrY